# Jekyll — Mozentai

## Stack

- Jekyll ~4.3, `jekyll-seo-tag`, GitHub Pages build action
- No SASS split: CSS lives inline in `_layouts/default.html`
- Content driven by `_data/*.yml` + Liquid includes
- Team photos live in `assets/team/` (CEO: `victor-matos.jpg`). Do not render the Leadership section on the public site.
- Hacker emblem: `assets/glider.gif` (animated) and `assets/glider.png` (static), footer only
- Services grid: four cards use `.cards.cards-2` (2x2). Engagement stays `.cards` (3 columns). Career Wall people grid is `.wall-grid`. Title ladder uses `.cards`.
- Engineer portraits: `assets/engineers/`. CSS forces grayscale plus mint wash. No photographic color on the wall.
- Title exams: `_data/exams.yml` holds per-code question groups (`questions: []` until authored). Career Wall cards read exam codes from `_data/career.yml` (P1, P2, P3). Never loop exam questions onto the public page.

## Adding a new section

1. Create `_data/<section>.yml`
2. Create `_includes/<section>.html` with `.reveal` classes for scroll animation
3. Add CSS to `_layouts/default.html`
4. `{% include <section>.html %}` in the `.below` div (order matters)
5. Build, commit, push, deploy

## Adding a client logo

- Fictional brands: PNG wordmark (convert from SVG locally, never commit SVG), icon + company name, white on transparent
- Real brands: official PNG artwork (SANEARES: white PNG from `~/github/saneares`)
- Save to `assets/clients/` as `.png` only. Do not leave `.svg` in the repo or on the live site.
- Add entry to `_data/clients.yml` under `europe`, `united_states`, or `brazil`
- Marquee duplicate loop in `clients.html` concatenates all three regions

## Local dev

```bash
bundle install
bundle exec jekyll serve
bundle exec jekyll build
```

## Layout notes

- Public homepage includes: pitch, stats, services, career, clients, certifications, hire-cta. Do not include testimonials.html or engagement.html.
- Hero lockup: `fitHeroLockup()` sizes `.wordmark` to min(86vw, 560px), then stretches `.tagline` letter-spacing to match. Do not size the mark to the tagline.
- `inner.html` is used by `/hire/` and `/hire/sent/`
- `inbox.html` is used by `/login/`
- `account.html` is used by `/account/` (engineer login, $20/month CREA)
- `company.html` is used by `/company/` (company login, $1,000/month plan)
- Account, Company, and Inbox `.gate { display: flex }` must be paired with `.gate[hidden] { display: none !important; }`. Without that, Sign in with Google stays on screen after Google auth.
- `error.html` is used only by `404.md`
- Contact form POSTs to FormSubmit at victor@mozentai.com, then redirects to `/hire/sent/`, and also writes Firestore `inquiries`
- Public CTA label is "Get in touch" on the homepage closer and inner topbar. Do not put Get in touch or victor@mozentai.com in the homepage footer.
- `/login/` is unlisted. Do not add it to the footer.
- `html lang` from `_config.yml` (`en-US`)
- `notranslate` meta prevents browser auto-translation to Portuguese
